        "title": "Bilateral biceps curl shows distinct biceps brachii and anterior deltoid excitation comparing straight vs. EZ barbell coupled with arms flexion/no-flexion (J Funct Morphol Kinesiol 8(1):13, 2023; PubMed 36810497)",
